{"pages":[{"segs":[["TRAINING",150.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,323.29999999999995,116.00059999999996,80,false],["OTHERS",150.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,294.50800000000004,176.00059999999996,80,false],["THE SOULARIUM TEAM",150.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,363.65999999999997,194.10059999999999,20,false],["YOUR ROLE IS CRITICAL: YOU SET THE STAGE",146.40000000000001,232.19150000000002,343.33399999999995,252.73149999999998,20,false],["When you teach another person how to use",146.40000000000001,251.80649999999991,309.35219999999993,264.20849999999996,9,false],["Soularium, you not only shape their experience,",146.40000000000001,264.80649999999991,326.97420000000011,277.20849999999996,9,false],["but the experience they pass on to others and, most",146.40000000000001,277.80649999999991,339.25920000000008,290.20849999999996,9,false],["importantly, the experience of the person with whom",146.40000000000001,290.80649999999997,347.37720000000013,303.20849999999996,9,false],["they use Soularium. So it’s critical they understand",146.40000000000001,303.80649999999997,339.30330000000015,316.20849999999996,9,false],["how the tool was meant to be used — the philosophy",146.40000000000001,316.80649999999997,341.93220000000008,329.20849999999996,9,false],["and understanding of God, people, and the gospel that",146.40000000000001,329.80649999999997,349.03230000000013,342.20849999999996,9,false],["shaped its design.",146.40000000000001,342.80649999999997,213.50400000000002,355.20849999999996,9,false],["Quite simply, how you train others matters.",146.40000000000001,368.80649999999997,309.93720000000008,381.20849999999996,9,false],["Consider this: The purpose of Soularium is not “to",146.40000000000001,394.61749999999995,348.64800000000002,407.60449999999997,9,false],["get to the gospel”.",146.40000000000001,407.61749999999995,217.0761,420.60449999999997,9,false],["THE HEART OF SOULARIUM",146.40000000000001,440.19149999999996,265.55800000000005,460.73149999999998,20,false],["Soularium is designed to help us genuinely and",146.40000000000001,459.80649999999997,323.96820000000008,472.20849999999996,9,false],["sincerely explore and understand another person’s",146.40000000000001,472.80649999999997,338.16120000000006,485.20849999999996,9,false],["story.",146.40000000000001,485.80649999999997,167.44200000000001,498.20849999999996,9,false],["TRAINING OTHERS 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,588.4692,9,false],["We are confident that the Holy Spirit will open doors",146.40000000000001,511.80650000000003,345.84630000000016,524.20849999999996,9,false],["to the gospel during many Soularium conversations",146.40000000000001,524.80650000000003,341.51730000000009,537.20849999999996,9,false],["— perhaps even most. But it’s possible to have a",146.40000000000001,537.80649999999991,324.44430000000006,550.20849999999996,9,false],["successful Soularium conversation that doesn’t get to",146.40000000000001,550.80649999999991,348.93330000000009,563.20849999999996,9,false],["the gospel.",146.40000000000001,563.80649999999991,186.756,576.20849999999996,9,false],["So this raises the question, what is a successful",146.40000000000001,589.80649999999991,324.21930000000003,602.20849999999996,9,false],["Soularium conversation? It’s successful if the user",146.40000000000001,602.80649999999991,336.92730000000006,615.20849999999996,9,false],["does these 5 things:",146.40000000000001,615.80649999999991,220.04610000000002,628.20849999999996,9,false],["• Initiates a conversation",159.90000000000001,641.80649999999991,255.74010000000001,654.20849999999996,9,false],["• Asks (open-ended) questions",159.90000000000001,654.80650000000003,276.63,667.20849999999996,9,false],["• Genuinely listens",159.90000000000001,667.80650000000003,232.6191,680.20849999999996,9,false],["• Explores the other person’s life story",159.90000000000001,680.80650000000003,304.71810000000005,693.20849999999996,9,false],["• Follows the leading of the Holy Spirit",159.90000000000001,693.80650000000003,306.53520000000003,706.20849999999996,9,false],["STEP-BY-STEP TRAINING PREP: 3 EASY STEPS",370.20000000000005,362.19149999999996,571.07200000000012,382.73149999999998,20,false],["STEP 1: GET READY",370.20000000000005,392.28649999999993,431.56500000000005,407.69149999999996,15,false],["All resources are found at: http:\/\/crupressgreen.com\/",370.20000000000005,407.80649999999997,571.92419999999993,420.20849999999996,9,false],["soularium\/",370.20000000000005,420.80649999999997,413.47109999999998,433.20849999999996,9,false],["• Download the Training Videos: “Getting",383.70000000000005,433.80649999999997,542.05310000000009,446.20849999999996,9,false],["Started” & “Going Deeper”",390.10800000000006,446.80649999999997,491.30220000000008,459.20849999999996,9,false],["• Download & print the article: “Training Videos",383.70000000000005,459.80649999999997,567.14420000000007,472.20849999999996,9,false],["Discussion Guide” (This is for you.)",390.10800000000006,472.80649999999997,524.82720000000018,485.20849999999996,9,false],["• Download & print the article: “How to Use",383.70000000000005,485.80649999999997,549.4511,498.20849999999996,9,false],["Soularium”",390.10800000000006,498.80650000000003,434.08200000000005,511.20850000000002,9,false],["(Print a copy for everyone who’s being trained.)",388.50600000000003,511.80650000000003,567.44220000000018,524.20849999999996,9,false],["• Purchase Soularium. (Ideally one per person,",383.70000000000005,524.80650000000003,562.32110000000011,537.20849999999996,9,false],["but could be shared by 2-3 in a training group if",390.10800000000006,537.80649999999991,568.07130000000018,550.20849999999996,9,false],["needed.)",390.10800000000006,550.80649999999991,422.87700000000007,563.20849999999996,9,false],["STEP 2: PREP",370.20000000000005,574.28649999999993,414.12000000000006,589.69150000000002,15,false],["• Watch the videos and read the articles yourself.",383.70000000000005,589.80649999999991,568.49430000000007,602.20849999999996,9,false],["(Don’t forget to do the action steps!)",388.50600000000003,602.80649999999991,524.68320000000006,615.20849999999996,9,false],["STEP 3: TRAINING DAY",370.20000000000005,626.28649999999993,443.84850000000006,641.69150000000002,15,false],["• Distribute Soularium to individuals or",383.70000000000005,641.80649999999991,534.88020000000006,654.20849999999996,9,false],["discussion groups.",390.10800000000006,654.80650000000003,460.40610000000004,667.20849999999996,9,false],["• Simply walk through the “Watch, Discuss,",383.70000000000005,667.80650000000003,548.31720000000018,680.20849999999996,9,false],["Practice, Share” steps in the article: “Training",390.10800000000006,680.80650000000003,563.67030000000011,693.20849999999996,9,false],["Videos Discussion Guide” (For large groups, see",390.10800000000006,693.80650000000003,571.09620000000007,706.20849999999996,9,false],["“Adapt to Fit Your Situation” below.)",388.50600000000003,706.80650000000003,526.93320000000006,719.20849999999996,9,false]],"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792},{"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792,"segs":[["TRAINING OTHERS 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,589.26120000000003,9,false],["• Give each person a copy of the article: “How to",159.90000000000001,33.434899999999857,340.79730000000006,45.836899999999901,9,false],["Use Soularium” as a summary\/reminder of what",166.30799999999999,46.434899999999857,349.42020000000008,58.836899999999901,9,false],["they’ve learned.",166.30799999999999,59.434899999999857,226.40100000000001,71.836899999999901,9,false],["ADAPT TO FIT YOUR SITUATION",146.40000000000001,91.819899999999961,282.13600000000002,112.35989999999993,20,false],["You can easily adapt the above steps to fit the",146.40000000000001,111.43489999999986,316.05720000000008,123.8368999999999,9,false],["number of people you’re training to use Soularium:",146.40000000000001,124.43489999999986,338.44920000000002,136.8368999999999,9,false],["individuals, small groups, and large groups. If it’s a",146.40000000000001,137.43489999999986,336.1173,149.8368999999999,9,false],["larger group, have them break down in smaller groups",146.40000000000001,150.43489999999986,349.31220000000008,162.8368999999999,9,false],["of 3-4 to discuss the questions and apply the action",146.40000000000001,163.43489999999986,339.1341000000001,175.8368999999999,9,false],["steps that you walk them through from up front.",146.40000000000001,176.43489999999986,327.51420000000007,188.8368999999999,9,false],["If you’d like to talk to one of the creators of Soularium",146.40000000000001,202.43489999999986,348.69120000000004,214.8368999999999,9,false],["email LeighAnn.Dull@cru.org.",146.40000000000001,215.43489999999986,262.86719999999997,227.8368999999999,9,false],["Enjoy using Soularium!",146.40000000000001,241.43489999999986,235.87800000000001,253.8368999999999,9,false],["~The Creators of Soularium",146.40000000000001,254.43489999999986,251.41200000000003,266.8368999999999,9,false]]}]}